   "html_text": "Biological individuals are an important feature of the world we live in. To better understand this we can start with a focal question: what are biological individuals? As simple as that sounds, it quickly leads to puzzling but illuminating complexities and variations in the biological world. To address these, it helps to articulate the larger conceptual space surrounding the focal question. A distinction between evolutionary and physiological individuals is also useful in thinking about biologic",
